1
00:00:00,834 --> 00:00:03,004
(Penny:)You went to the dirty store
without me?!

2
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:04,503
(laughs)

3
00:00:04,504 --> 00:00:08,644
(Leonard:)In sunglasses and a hat after
I parked two blocks away.

4
00:00:08,642 --> 00:00:10,912
Well, get it!
Get it for me!
Yeah?

5
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:13,411
(Sheldon:)Yeah.
Okay, uh, well,
I hope it's fun.

6
00:00:13,413 --> 00:00:16,183
I mean, it-it comes
with paints, and-and

7
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:18,013
(Leonard:)it's kind of creative
and artistic.

8
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:21,418
(Penny:)Okay, did you go to
the dirty store or Michaels?

9
00:00:22,388 --> 00:00:24,258
(Emily:)No, no.

10
00:00:24,257 --> 00:00:26,387
(Leonard:)We cover ourselves
in body paint,

11
00:00:26,393 --> 00:00:29,993
and then-then we get on this
big canvas and do our thing.

12
00:00:29,996 --> 00:00:32,666
(Penny:)Whoa, that's kind of
a big step for a guy

13
00:00:32,666 --> 00:00:35,666
(Penny:)who only recently agreed
to take his socks off.

14
00:00:35,669 --> 00:00:38,069
(Leonard:)You're making fun of me.
Forget it.

15
00:00:38,071 --> 00:00:39,971
No! No, come on,
I want to do it.
Really?

16
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:41,943
(Penny:)Yeah, let's you, me,

17
00:00:41,942 --> 00:00:44,572
(Penny:)and your very, very pale feet
make some art.

18
00:00:44,578 --> 00:00:45,908
(chuckles)

19
00:00:45,912 --> 00:00:48,442
(Penny:)Hey, when you got back to this
store, I want to go with you.

20
00:00:48,448 --> 00:00:52,318
(Leonard:)Okay, but it's a drive-- the
one I went to is in San Diego.

21
00:00:53,619 --> 00:00:55,919
(Howard:)How are the taxes going?

22
00:00:55,922 --> 00:00:57,592
(Leonard:)Okay.

23
00:00:57,591 --> 00:01:02,021
(Bernadette:)But you got a lot of receipts
for the Lego store in here.

